type: software
title: "Supplementary code for: Optimizing Computing Resource Sharing across Administrative Boundaries in the AI and Edge Era"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible example of Section 5.8 (Table 9), comparing placement only,
  replication, and checkpoint-based recovery for deadline-constrained GPU tasks
  on revocable shared GPUs, and the documented OpenAlex literature search of
  Section 2.4 (Table A1).
